<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES AND INDIA DRAW FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES AND INDIA DRAW FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first test between West Indies and India ended in a draw on the rain-hit fifth and final day at Sabina Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 427 and 241-4 declared, India 346 and 99-2.</p>
</text>
